      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have found a workaround that does not involve modding VRChat, modding the client, hacking the SDK or re-uploading your avatar. Basically, it's no different than OVR Toolkit.\nBest part? It's free. It's called OVR SmoothTracking and you can download it here https://booth.pm/ja/items/4018006! Watch the demonstration at https://www.youtube.com/shorts/xv0WWVkQgZw\nHopefully, VRChat will implement a solution that the majority of players can stand behind like the one you described, Towneh.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
